xfce4-xmenu-plugin (0.4.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Rename the plugin to Xmenu and use Command logo assets.
  * Add configurable About, Software Update and Force Quit applications.
  * Set LCOS menu defaults and remove themed panel button borders.
  * Add Devuan package builds and manual draft releases.
  * Update package maintainer to Cowboy of Christ.

